# Database
legacy/mongodb/

# Real client case files (scanned IDs, credit bureau reports, selfies) — highly sensitive PII,
# must never enter git history. Only the small curated subset copied into app/frontend/public/
# for the UI preview is tracked.
legacy/sdevtech/

# Legacy Excel exports (real client names/balances: Clients.xlsx, Loan Accounts Details.xlsx,
# Daily Collection Report.xlsx, etc.) — untracked going forward, 2026-07-06 verification pass.
# Deliberately does NOT cover legacy/reports/201 Loan Docs Generator/ — that subfolder is the
# cited ADR-009/ADR-010 evidence base (templates + formula workbook) and stays tracked.
legacy/reports/*.xlsx

# The live, macro-enabled "OFFICIAL CALCULATOR OF EASYCASH" workbook (.xlsm) — this is not a
# template, it's the company's actual current production ledger: real client names, birthdates,
# SSS/TIN numbers, addresses, co-borrower/character-reference PII, and a full edit-history audit
# trail, with entries as recent as this analysis. Same sensitivity class as legacy/sdevtech/ and
# legacy/reports/*.xlsx above — must never enter git history. Added 2026-07-07 after this file was
# found sitting untracked but NOT gitignored (the *.xlsx rule above doesn't match .xlsm).
legacy/reports/*.xlsm

